Package: rddinterf
Title: Regression Discontinuity Designs Under Interference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Elena", "Dal Torrione", email = "elena.daltorrione@yale.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Tiziano", "Arduini", role = "aut"),
    person("Laura", "Forastiere", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3721-9826"))
    )
Description: Implements the distance-based local polynomial
    estimators proposed by Dal Torrione, Arduini, and Forastiere (2024)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2410.02727> for sharp regression discontinuity designs
    when outcomes may depend on the treatment assignments of connected units.
    The package constructs effective-treatment boundaries, estimates direct
    and indirect effects, and provides network-robust inference.
